            },
            {
              "pattern": "^(?:[Aa][Cc][Cc][Ee](?:[Ss\u017f][Ss\u017f]\\-[Tt][Oo][Kk\u212a][Ee][Nn]|[\u00df\u1e9e]\\-[Tt][Oo][Kk\u212a][Ee][Nn])|[Aa][Cc][Cc][Ee](?:[Ss\u017f][Ss\u017f]_[Tt][Oo][Kk\u212a][Ee][Nn]|[\u00df\u1e9e]_[Tt][Oo][Kk\u212a][Ee][Nn])|[Aa][Pp][Ii]\\-[Kk\u212a][Ee][Yy]|[Aa][Pp][Ii]_[Kk\u212a][Ee][Yy]|[Aa][Pp][Ii][Kk\u212a][Ee][Yy]|[Aa][Uu][Tt][Hh][Oo][Rr][Ii][Zz][Aa][Tt][Ii][Oo][Nn]|[Cc][Ll][Ii][Ee][Nn][Tt]\\-[Ss\u017f][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]|[Cc][Ll][Ii][Ee][Nn][Tt]_[Ss\u017f][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]|[Cc][Oo][Dd][Ee]|[Cc][Rr][Ee][Dd][Ee][Nn][Tt][Ii][Aa][Ll]|[Cc][Rr][Ee][Dd][Ee][Nn][Tt][Ii][Aa][Ll][Ss\u017f]|[Pp][Aa](?:[Ss\u017f][Ss\u017f][Ww][Oo][Rr][Dd]|[\u00df\u1e9e][Ww][Oo][Rr][Dd])|[Rr][Ee][Ff][Rr][Ee][Ss\u017f][Hh]\\-[Tt][Oo][Kk\u212a][Ee][Nn]|[Rr][Ee][Ff][Rr][Ee][Ss\u017f][Hh]_[Tt][Oo][Kk\u212a][Ee][Nn]|[Ss\u017f][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]|[Ss\u017f][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]\\-[Rr][Ee][Ff]|[Ss\u017f][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]\\-[Ss\u017f][Cc][Oo][Pp][Ee]|[Ss\u017f][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]_[Rr][Ee][Ff]|[Ss\u017f][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]_[Ss\u017f][Cc][Oo][Pp][Ee]|[Ss\u017f][Ii][Gg]|[Ss\u017f][Ii][Gg][Nn][Aa][Tt][Uu][Rr][Ee]|[Tt][Oo][Kk\u212a][Ee][Nn])(?![\\s\\S])"
